<title>USA: Immunex to settle Cistron suit.</title>
<headline>Immunex to settle Cistron suit.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Immunex Corp will settle a lawsuit brought by Cistron Biotechnology Inc alleging the theft of intellectual property, an Immunex spokeswoman said Thursday.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman, Valoree Dowell, confirmed a published report that the company would settle the suit, though she declined to disclose details, saying the two companies were working on a joint statement.</p>
<p>The three-year-old case had been scheduled to go to trial in federal court next week.</p>
</text>
